text=text.replace('PowerShell returned a nonzero wrapper status for a completed optional precomputation; `python run_r.py precompute_last.R precompute-last-verified.log` revalidated its saved fits and confirmed the native status: `R NATIVE EXIT 0: precompute_last.R; log precompute-last-verified.log`.', 'PowerShell returned nonzero wrapper statuses despite completed R runs. The native-exit checks below confirmed successful checkpoint validation and completion directly, bypassing PowerShell stderr/status translation.')
